{"id":"2157705992261ede67dee4c69bbd77fee96087b7","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239687","title":"给我整乐呵了，商汤上了 deepseek v4 flash 和 pro","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yiranw09","excerpt":"程序员 - @yiranw09 - 大概率是自己部署的，不清楚量化程度，有 1M 上下文我测试了 deepseek v4 flash ，输出比较忙，只有 40t/s 的水平（牛来水平）目前公测，仅用免费挡位，5 小时窗口 600","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>大概率是自己部署的，不清楚量化程度，有 1M 上下文<br>我测试了 deepseek v4 flash ，输出比较忙，只有 40t/s 的水平（牛来水平）<br>目前公测，仅用免费挡位，5 小时窗口 60000 积分，周额度 600000 积分（ 10 倍 5 小时）<br>但是有意思的是，在我测试 deepseekv4flash 的时候，1M 的 token ，80%的缓存，大约用了 2000 积分<br>也就是说它 5 小时窗口有 30M 的 deepseek v4 flash ，一周有 3 亿<br>这个是免费的啊？<br>笑，甚至还有个生图模型</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053082\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c6a87e0ee936531b8481006814570300?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qaq13037\" data-uid=\"604007\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qaq13037\">qaq13037</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 15:57:19 +08:00\">8h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>商汤纯粹是起了个大早，赶了个晚集。自己没那么多卡，还学人卖 token plan ，用免费来吸引用户是个好策略，但是给的并发实测不超过 3 ，放 agent 里根本不可用，你哪怕少点用量呢，大家还想去体验下，完全不明白他们的思路，反人类行为。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053092\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7460/e1cd/274090_normal.png?m=1765551963\" alt=\"Danswerme\" data-uid=\"274090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Danswerme\">Danswerme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 16:01:10 +08:00\">7h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内这些公司搞的所谓积分我一直没搞明白是怎么算的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053099\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe6120a7281cce0ecab2b545d1ccdf5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"flning\" data-uid=\"373676\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flning\">flning</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 16:05:46 +08:00\">7h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>嘘，小点声，我怕人多给他冲跨了，连这点小毛都不给用了，我把它挂上龙虾，跑点定时任务，收集点任务啥的，还是够用的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053105\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c1bb/a6af/550058_normal.png?m=1784018507\" alt=\"Frankcox\" data-uid=\"550058\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Frankcox\">Frankcox</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 16:08:45 +08:00\">7h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在的不清楚，之前它家 deepseek 的 api 有自己的审核，官网能破限的内容会被商汤他们 api 卡死</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053224\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ede3f5058652c3b0b20c3fc0b1be977c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cinhoo\" data-uid=\"103836\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cinhoo\">cinhoo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 17:28:10 +08:00\">6h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>实际用下来 v4flash 很耐用，完全用不完。<br>但是其他的 glm ，k3 很不耐用，分析个项目就没了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053261\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3590/0a98/173969_normal.png?m=1747363963\" alt=\"coderluan\" data-uid=\"173969\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderluan\">coderluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 17:58:10 +08:00\">6h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>他那个 plan 除了 ds ，还有他家自己的模型，重点是双方是单独的计量的，所以这个商业目的其实挺明显的，就是当 ds 用光之后，用户可以顺手尝试下自家模型，之后去掉 ds 模型，相当于给自家模型拉了波用户。但是现在看应该是效果不行，因为他之前去掉过 ds 了，但是现在又给加回去了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053268\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 18:03:59 +08:00\">5h 56m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直都有啊，都用好几个月了，火星救援</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053285\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9b48c21b50efb7776d75259eb374cbda?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"unpay\" data-uid=\"610890\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/unpay\">unpay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 18:16:20 +08:00\">5h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在用电信提供的 deepseek v4 。。3 折爽呆了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053289\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe6120a7281cce0ecab2b545d1ccdf5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"flning\" data-uid=\"373676\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flning\">flning</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 18:19:57 +08:00\">5h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/unpay\">unpay</a> 求一下电信路径，我两地电信卡，我限制基本上 DSV4 重度了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053349\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f352/8906/309227_normal.png?m=1780325220\" alt=\"la9998372\" data-uid=\"309227\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/la9998372\">la9998372</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 19:04:27 +08:00\">4h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道为啥，我调用商汤的模型，经常容易 429</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \