              <p>一直 429 ，薅了给 v 友们用，压根用不了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053616\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3c2acd7d4430c57e93f3dd4dc6448a42?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jetsung\" data-uid=\"779164\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jetsung\">jetsung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 22:51:09 +08:00\">1h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>它这 6W 积分，连 1W 都用不动。动不动就 429 。浪费时间，压根没有体验。连 deepseek v4 flash 都玩不明白，还上 K3 等模型。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053672\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3235f0cda8845c15590a7b5de5c89f10?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"stefwoo\" data-uid=\"32465\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/stefwoo\">stefwoo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-05 23:33:18 +08:00\">27 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>429 太多了，浪费时间。跑 agent 甚至不如接 google aistudio 免费的 gemini</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18053694\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5969/f6ba/69824_normal.png?m=1764731270\" alt=\"linbenyi\" data-uid=\"69824\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/linbenyi\">linbenyi</a><